{"title":"ASUS ROG Xbox Ally","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"asus-rog-xbox-ally-x-gaming-handheld-black-amd-ryzen-ai-z2-extreme-amd-radeon-graphics-24gb-ram-1tb-ssd-7fhd-120hz-display","title":"ASUS ROG XBOX Ally X, AMD Ryzen AI Z2 Extreme Processor,24GB RAM, 1TB SSD,7\"\/17.8cm, FHD,Touchscreen,120Hz, Gaming Handheld PC","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/57ee1a13-ddeb-42e1-bd99-8ddccb3c021a.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/57ee1a13-ddeb-42e1-bd99-8ddccb3c021a.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"a55bq9-r3wegq-4zi8nq-a470bb\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-7 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-7\" data-csa-c-id=\"av784y-6ih68e-19r1y0-s8esbv\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-spacing apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0d79d9e6-ea2c-4b9e-bf69-7f8677906c62.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0d79d9e6-ea2c-4b9e-bf69-7f8677906c62.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-rightthirdcol\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-rightthirdcol-inner\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-small a-size-small\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePower on directly into the Xbox full screen experience. Access Game Bar and more with the Xbox button.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePowered by the AMD Ryzen AI Z2 Extreme, the ROG Xbox Ally X plays AAA games smoothly, with an NPU that unlocks future AI experiences.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe ROG Xbox Ally X features a redesigned chassis with contoured grips inspired by Xbox, delivering balanced comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eXbox gaming meets ROG engineering in the ROG Xbox Ally X: portable, powerful, and made for AAA gaming anywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eROG Xbox Ally X\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e#playALLYourgames\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWe want gamers to have the best handheld experience possible. So together with Xbox, we've created a smoother, more intuitive interface. Now, when you power on your ROG Xbox Ally X, you're dropped straight into the Xbox full screen experience - a console-inspired Ul optimized for joystick and button controls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"20le1r-fafp6e-x2phu8-2lzpua\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c0cfff90-bf20-483e-9e3d-aadfab77a65e.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c0cfff90-bf20-483e-9e3d-aadfab77a65e.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eNext-gen Performance\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003ePowered by the AMD Ryzen AI Z2 Extreme, the ROG Xbox Ally X delivers next-gen graphics and ultra-smooth gameplay with AFMF. As the first AI-powered handheld, its built-in NPU is ready for the future of gaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ca886949-10b8-48dd-8575-b24ee6cc76c8.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ca886949-10b8-48dd-8575-b24ee6cc76c8.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLess Charging. More Boss Fights.\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003ePortability means everything for a handheld, which is why we’ve equipped the ROG Xbox Ally X with a massive 80Wh battery. And it’s not just about battery size. The new Ryzen AI Z2 Extreme delivers greater efficiency and performance across the board: playing in Silent Mode will feel like the previous generation's Performance Mode, while giving you more playtime.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/74d302e2-a18e-4384-8329-c81d6f5085f2.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/74d302e2-a18e-4384-8329-c81d6f5085f2.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eInspired by Xbox controls\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eComfortable. Familiar. The ROG Xbox Ally is designed to feel natural, just like your favorite Xbox controller. Dedicated textured grips allow for a more secure hold — the perfect fit for comfortable long sessions at home or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"hem2d9-k2j400-1c728r-mgdk94\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0a7a6b6e-6f6a-41cd-98c4-1e76331afc94.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0a7a6b6e-6f6a-41cd-98c4-1e76331afc94.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eFeel the Incredible Immersion\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWe’ve added a vibration motor into both triggers of the ROG Xbox Ally X, offering a huge upgrade to immersion. With independent trigger vibration, anything from racing a supercar to destroying hordes of zombies will feel incredibly visceral.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ffdc1f43-36d5-4681-a8f8-f9bee243239d.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ffdc1f43-36d5-4681-a8f8-f9bee243239d.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eSee it. Hear it. Feel it\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThe Xbox Ally X features a bright 7” 1080p touchscreen with 120Hz refresh rate and FreeSync Premium for ultra-smooth gameplay — even outdoors. Protected by Gorilla Glass and powered by dual Smart Amp speakers, it’s built to look great and sound even better.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"RC73XA-NH011W\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3269ab2b-77d0-4b03-9fac-1453458a11a0.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3269ab2b-77d0-4b03-9fac-1453458a11a0.__CR0,0,1000,1000_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003ePlay all your games at full power\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eExperience the latest PC and Game Pass titles fueled by the high-performance Windows hardware in the ROG Xbox Ally X.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module basic-module-13-text aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-basic-module-13-text\" data-csa-c-id=\"34x8w3-882ft7-lo07rj-69war9\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-basic-module-13-text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module aplus-module-13\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module-section aplus-text-section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"description\"\u003e*All specifications are subject to change without notice. Please check for exact specifications. Products may not be available in all markets.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"description\"\u003e*Specifications and features vary by model, and all images are illustrative.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"description\"\u003e*PCB color and bundled software versions are subject to change without notice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"description\"\u003e*Brand and product names mentioned are trademarks of their respective companies.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Asus","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47661276168414,"sku":null,"price":1000.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7614cafa-a8c3-4bb4-bb5e-77b2581efe9a.jpg?v=1762462894"},{"product_id":"asus-rog-xbox-ally-7-1080p-120hz-gaming-handheld-touchscreen-amd-ryzen™-z2-a-16gb-ram-512gb-ssd-white","title":"ASUS ROG Xbox Ally 7” 1080p 120Hz Gaming Handheld Touchscreen AMD Ryzen™ Z2 A 16GB RAM 512GB SSD White","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-21-card1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-top-gutter=\"\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" data-csa-c-id=\"agh0rh-f0h8rs-a8ibu6-pfh5yk\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-22\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-21-card2\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"ROG Xbox Ally\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0c53574b-1a01-4850-b62c-907d13c1a002.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0c53574b-1a01-4850-b62c-907d13c1a002.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"64vjys-y2l4sw-n7bbeo-2kw8qo\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"vwqqgu-116o1d-9yq4rq-xwrrn8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"ROG Xbox Ally\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c4bec467-3081-4f08-90dd-4eea28eb230c.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c4bec467-3081-4f08-90dd-4eea28eb230c.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"whzeqj-1mbkdo-6cfdu-53jga8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"ROG Xbox Ally\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/db34f03c-8ccc-460d-a181-2ff8d14803a2.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/db34f03c-8ccc-460d-a181-2ff8d14803a2.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"5viwi7-74c0xw-16scts-jxngl0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"ROG Xbox Ally\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0b934027-1b83-45b3-89ac-07e09880a76d.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0b934027-1b83-45b3-89ac-07e09880a76d.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"h7334w-tbr67t-iow01b-lld9zk\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"ROG Xbox Ally\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/4926b1e5-4d93-44f7-9ca5-603b216f2e91.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/4926b1e5-4d93-44f7-9ca5-603b216f2e91.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Asus","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47661292290270,"sku":null,"price":600.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_df146309-6d38-4d56-872c-7db9f1d106dd.jpg?v=1762463466"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.gamers-stop.com\/collections\/asus-rog-xbox-ally.oembed","provider":"Gamers Stop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}